    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26123" root="ضهى" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَهِىٌّ</span></b> , (S, K,) of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعِيلٌ</span>, (S,) The
<i>like</i> of another [thing or person]: (S, K:) one
says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا ضَهِىُّ هٰذَا</span> <i>This is the like of this:</i> (S:)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ ضَهِيُّكَ</span> <i>He is the like of thee.</i> (K.)

